{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0177-s006", "text": "Du måste betala tillbaka studielånet när du har slutfört dina studier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045520858589+0000-4/hb-c08-u0177-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.274566650390625, "generation_seconds": 18.3969049139414, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0178-s001", "text": "Du kan få studiestödets bostadstillägg om du har rätt till studiestöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045520858589+0000-4/hb-c08-u0178-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.306121826171875, "generation_seconds": 22.309889575000852, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0178-s002", "text": "Du kan få bostadstillägg för en hyresbostad eller en bostadsrättsbostad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045520858589+0000-4/hb-c08-u0178-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.28192138671875, "generation_seconds": 20.852513146121055, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0178-s003", "text": "Du kan endast få bostadstillägg för de månader då du studerar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045520858589+0000-4/hb-c08-u0178-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.2550048828125, "generation_seconds": 21.592483726795763, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0179-s001", "text": "Skolresestödet (koulumatkatuki) ersätter kostnaderna för skolresor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045520858589+0000-4/hb-c08-u0179-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.28570556640625, "generation_seconds": 21.0490967950318, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0179-s002", "text": "Du kan få skolresestöd om du studerar och bor i Finland och har en lång skolresa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045520858589+0000-4/hb-c08-u0179-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.300750732421875, "generation_seconds": 25.2060758380685, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0180-s001", "text": "I vissa fall kan du ha rätt till skolresestöd om du studerar i gymnasiet eller vid en yrkesläroanstalt eller deltar i förberedande utbildning för dem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045520858589+0000-4/hb-c08-u0180-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.678095238095239, "peak": 0.334075927734375, "generation_seconds": 40.28418925614096, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0180-s002", "text": "Du ska ha minst tio resedagar per månad och en tillräckligt lång skolresa för att få stöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-finansiering/narration/resume-20261103T045520858589+0000-4/hb-c08-u0180-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.27642822265625, "generation_seconds": 24.63883569301106, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
